comments.body:
@aaronpk 

I think this PR is good.

However, one point: I had been planning to mention this eventually, but in both the pre-change and post-change drafts, the `aud` value in the JWT-SVID example is set to the token endpoint URL. Since the specification itself states, *"Verify that the aud claim contains only the issuer identifier of the authorization server as its sole value. See [I-D.draft-ietf-oauth-rfc7523bis] for details."*, it would be better to change the `aud` value in the example from `https://as.example.com/token` to `https://as.example.com`.
